m></div><span class="rz-st " aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><h3>Beautiful quality</h3><p>The bouclé bed is even nicer in person, and Biscuit has barely left it. Delivery was quick and it came beautifully packed.</p><div class="rz-meta"><span>Date of experience: 3 days ago</span><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/all">Bolster Bed, Moss Bouclé</a></div></article><article class="rz-it rq1-it" data-cat="Coats"><div class="rz-who"><span class="rz-av">AC</span><div><b>Arthur C.</b><span>GB &middot; Verified</span></div><em>3 days ago</em></div><span class="rz-st " aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><h3>Perfect fit for our dachshund</h3><p>Long enough in the back and easy to wash. The size guide was spot on.</p><div class="rz-meta"><span>Date of experience: 3 days ago</span><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/all">Dog Coat Dachshund Puffer</a></div></article><article class="rz-it rq1-it" data-cat="Coats"><div class="rz-who"><span class="rz-av">MS</span><div><b>Morley S.</b><span>GB &middot; Verified</span></div><em>4 days ago</em></div><span class="rz-st " aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><h3>Delivered the next day</h3><p>Lovely packaging and the coat is beautifully made. Will order again.</p><div class="rz-meta"><span>Date of experience: 4 days ago</span><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/all">Dog Coat Alaska AKTIV</a></div></article><article class="rz-it rq1-it" data-cat="Walking"><div class="rz-who"><span class="rz-av">R</span><div><b>Rob</b><span>GB &middot; Verified</span></div><em>5 days ago</em></div><span class="rz-st " aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><h3>Quality of materials</h3><p>Quality of materials, design and solid stitching. You can tell it&rsquo;s made to last.</p><div class="rz-meta"><span>Date of experience: 5 days ago</span><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/all">Leather Collar, Cognac</a></div></article><article class="rz-it rq1-it" data-cat="Coats"><div class="rz-who"><span class="rz-av">HW</span><div><b>Hannah W.</b><span>GB &middot; Verified</span></div><em>1 week ago</em></div><span class="rz-st " aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><h3>Lovely to deal with</h3><p>Helpful with sizing and quick to reply. Swapped a size for us without any fuss.</p><div class="rz-meta"><span>Date of experience: 1 week ago</span><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/all">Dog Raincoat Dublin 2.0</a></div></article><article class="rz-it rq1-it" data-cat="Gifts"><div class="rz-who"><span class="rz-av">EL</span><div><b>Emma L.</b><span>GB &middot; Verified</span></div><em>1 week ago</em></div><span class="rz-st " aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><h3>Gift for my sister</h3><p>Wrapped beautifully with a handwritten note. She loved it.</p><div class="rz-meta"><span>Date of experience: 1 week ago</span><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/all">Winter Gift Set</a></div></article><article class="rz-it rq1-it" data-cat="Dining"><div class="rz-who"><span class="rz-av">JP</span><div><b>James P.</b><span>GB &middot; Verified</span></div><em>2 weeks ago</em></div><span class="rz-st " aria-label="Rated 4 out of 5"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i class="o"></i></span><h3>Great bowl, slow delivery</h3><p>The stoneware bowl is gorgeous. Took four days to arrive rather than two, but worth the wait.</p><div class="rz-meta"><span>Date of experience: 2 weeks ago</span><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/all">Stoneware Bowl, Chalk</a></div><div class="rz-rep"><b>Reply from Axel &amp; Hound</b><p>Thank you, James. Sorry for the wait; we&rsquo;ve moved to a faster courier for stoneware since.</p></div></article><article class="rz-it rq1-it" data-cat="Coats"><div class="rz-who"><span class="rz-av">SR</span><div><b>Sophie R.</b><span>GB &middot; Verified</span></div><em>2 weeks ago</em></div><span class="rz-st " aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><h3>Our whippet is finally warm</h3><p>The Alaska coat covers her chest properly. No more shivering on morning walks.</p><div class="rz-meta"><span>Date of experience: 2 weeks ago</span><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/all">Dog Coat Alaska AKTIV</a></div></article><article class="rz-it rq1-it" data-cat="Walking"><div class="rz-who"><span class="rz-av">DK</span><div><b>Daniel K.</b><span>GB &middot; Verified</span></div><em>3 weeks ago</em></div><span class="rz-st " aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><h3>Easy return</h3><p>Wrong size, sent it back with the free label and had the refund in three days.</p><div class="rz-meta"><span>Date of experience: 3 weeks ago</span><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/all">Padded Harness, Olive</a></div></article><article class="rz-it rq1-it" data-cat="Beds"><div class="rz-who"><span class="rz-av">LM</span><div><b>Lucy M.</b><span>GB &middot; Verified</span></div><em>3 weeks ago</em></div><span class="rz-st " aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><h3>Worth every penny</h3><p>The orthopaedic bed has made a real difference to our old lab.</p><div class="rz-meta"><span>Date of experience: 3 weeks ago</span><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/all">Orthopaedic Bed, Charcoal</a></div></article><article class="rz-it rq1-it" data-cat="Walking"><div class="rz-who"><span class="rz-av">OT</span><div><b>Olivia T.</b><span>GB &middot; Verified</span></div><em>1 month ago</em></div><span class="rz-st " aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><h3>Gorgeous and practical</h3><p>The waxed lead has softened beautifully and still looks smart after a wet winter.</p><div class="rz-meta"><span>Date of experience: 1 month ago</span><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/all">Waxed Cotton Lead, Olive</a></div></article><article class="rz-it rq1-it" data-cat="Beds"><div class="rz-who"><span class="rz-av">BH</span><div><b>Ben H.</b><span>GB &middot; Verified</span></div><em>1 month ago</em></div><span class="rz-st " aria-label="Rated 4 out of 5"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i class="o"></i></span><h3>Lovely bed, big box</h3><p>Took a day to fluff up properly, but our spaniel adores it.</p><div class="rz-meta"><span>Date of experience: 1 month ago</span><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/all">Round Bed, Oat Wool</a></div><div class="rz-rep"><b>Reply from Axel &amp; Hound</b><p>Thank you, Ben. Good tip about letting it fluff up, we&rsquo;ll add that to the page.</p></div></article><article class="rz-it rq1-it" data-cat="Beds" hidden><div class="rz-who"><span class="rz-av">IF</span><div><b>Isla F.</b><span>GB &middot; Verified</span></div><em>1 month ago</em></div><span class="rz-st " aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><h3>The nicest thing in our house</h3><p>I bought the bolster bed for the dog and now I want one for myself. The bouclé is beautiful.</p><div class="rz-meta"><span>Date of experience: 1 month ago</span><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/all">Bolster Bed, Moss Bouclé</a></div></article><article class="rz-it rq1-it" data-cat="Coats" hidden><div class="rz-who"><span class="rz-av">TR</span><div><b>Tom R.</b><span>GB &middot; Verified</span></div><em>1 month ago</em></div><span class="rz-st " aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><h3>Finally, a coat that fits a whippet</h3><p>Covers her chest, doesn&rsquo;t slip, and she doesn&rsquo;t mind wearing it. That&rsquo;s a first.</p><div class="rz-meta"><span>Date of experience: 1 month ago</span><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/all">Dog Coat Alaska AKTIV</a></div></article><article class="rz-it rq1-it" data-cat="Walking" hidden><div class="rz-who"><span class="rz-av">PN</span><div><b>Priya N.</b><span>GB &middot; Verified</span></div><em>2 months ago</em></div><span class="rz-st " aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><h3>Packed like a present</h3><p>Every order arrives wrapped in tissue with a little note. It feels special every time.</p><div class="rz-meta"><span>Date of experience: 2 months ago</span><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/all">Leather Collar, Cognac</a></div></article><article class="rz-it rq1-it" data-cat="Walking" hidden><div class="rz-who"><span class="rz-av">MD</span><div><b>Mark D.</b><span>GB &middot; Verified</span></div><em>2 months ago</em></div><span class="rz-st " aria-label="Rated 4 out of 5"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i class="o"></i></span><h3>Great lead, runs long</h3><p>Lovely leather and stitching. A little longer than I expected, so check the length.</p><div class="rz-meta"><span>Date of experience: 2 months ago</span><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/all">Leather Lead, Cognac</a></div></article></div><div class="rz-more"><p>Showing <b class="rz-n">12</b> of 1,240 reviews</p><button type="button" class="rz-btn rz-o" data-more>Load more reviews</button></div></div></section><section class="rz-write"><div class="rz-w"><img class="rz-tpl" src="{{ 'trustpilot.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Trustpilot" width="146" height="36"><h2>Bought something from us?</h2><p>Tell other dog owners how it&rsquo;s going. Every review helps someone choose.</p><div class="rz-cta"><a class="rz-btn rz-g" href="#">Review us on Trustpilot</a><a class="rz-btn rz-o" href="#">Read all reviews</a></div></div></section></div>


